        <mxCell id="d_lg_sem" value="调度语义&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px&quot;&gt;应用层 StateGraph 执行&lt;br&gt;Core 通过 Adapter 持有统一入口&lt;br&gt;Projector 将 state 收束为 WorkflowRun&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e5b46e;fontSize=15;fontColor=#51320c;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=16;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
